@title 3D view: metal finish on the plate and rails, and the switch back to flat colours
@area 3D
# Layers > Metal finish (also View > 3D > Metal finish). On: a faint brushed grain on the plate and streaks along the rails. Off: the flat colours as before. The pictures are the same view with the switch on and off.
click_text "Open example"
wait 20
click_text 3D #1
wait 40
shot finish-on
check_layout
key ctrl+k
wait 6
text front view
wait 8
key Enter
wait 40
shot front-on
click_text "Layers"
wait 8
shot layers-menu
expect "Metal finish"
click_text "Metal finish"
wait 8
key Escape
wait 30
shot front-off
check_layout
